OL,3,GNEWSASection of major route shut
OL,4,Afollowing HGV fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major route in West Sussex has been
OL,7,Fclosed after an HGV fire.
OL,9,FAt about 18:00 BST, West Sussex Fire
OL,10,Fand Rescue Service said the southbound
OL,11,Fstretch of the A23 between Handcross
OL,12,Fand Slaugham had been closed because of
OL,13,Fthe vehicle fire, but the northbound
OL,14,Fcarriageway remained open.
OL,16,FThe fire service urged people to avoid
OL,17,Fthe area while they tackled the blaze.
OL,19,FNational Highways said at about 18:30
OL,20,Fthere were four miles of congestion and
OL,21,Fdelays of about an hour.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
